// Golden first-testnet ConfigParam30 leaf for Simplex protocol v2.
// Keep this encoding synchronized with crypto/smartcont/gen-zerostate.fif
// and test/tostester/src/tostester/zerostate.py.

"Config.fif" include

dictnew
<b 400 32 u, b> <s 0 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 1000 32 u, b> <s 1 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 250 32 u, b> <s 10 rot 8 udict! drop
<b x{22} s, 0 5 u, 2 2 u, 1 1 u, 4 32 u, swap dict, b>

hashu 0x6ADBFE8D74E95D62C7E2FC6F4615C7C628B476E1D06142F8A532F619BDD28814
= not abort"unexpected Simplex v2 genesis cell hash"
